{"title":"Equity sentences to ponder","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920050850/0/marginalrevolution~Equity-sentences-to-ponder.html","date":1749624163000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Relative to prior observational methods, the estimates suggest a substantial role for amenity substitution in explaining the gender pay gap—accounting for roughly two-thirds of the observed gap—and little role for amenities in explaining inequalities by race or parent background.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is from <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://alexbell.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Job-Amenities-and-Earnings-Inequality.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">a new paper by Alex Bell</a>, via Daniel.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/equity-sentences-to-ponder.html\">Equity sentences to ponder</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920050850/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920050850/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920050850/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920050850/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920050850/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920050850/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolut